<title>UK: Laporte profits rise underlying 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Laporte profits rise underlying 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		21.1		   vs 4.3</p>
<p> Shr pre-excep (pence)  46.9		   vs 41.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 15.75		  vs 14.50</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 24.25		  vs 23.00</p>
<p> Pretax pre execep	127.0		  vs 113.2</p>
<p> Pretax		     78.7		   vs 24.5</p>
<p>Turnover 1,077 vs 1,084</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 114.3 and 124.0 million stg before exceptionals.</p>
<p>Full company name - Laporte Plc</p>
